Spaces Status
https://github.com/filipores/herdr-spaces-status

This distribution contains a modified copy of the Spaces mod from Herdr App:
https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app/blob/v0.1.11/defaults/mods/spaces/main.js
Herdr App is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Modifications by filipores add green/orange attention glows, a neutral animated
working contour, optional agent navigation commands, and corresponding checks
and documentation.
The original mod metadata is retained in mods/spaces-glow/mod.json, with its
display title changed to Spaces Status.

Herdr's runtime, fonts and icon assets are not redistributed here.
This is an independent community mod, not an official Herdr release.

